            {
              "id": "6",
              "content": "<p class=\"mb-4\">The lucky man was the <u class=\"font-bold\">only</u> winner of the grand prize. [ 6 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">She was so worried about her mother's health that she went to church to <u class=\"font-bold\">talk to God</u>. [ 7 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">He <u class=\"font-bold\">coughed and had difficulty breathing</u> after eating a large piece of food. [ 8 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">The rain <u class=\"font-bold\">stopped</u> in the early morning after pouring all night long. [ 9 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">There is a <u class=\"font-bold\">large number</u> of people in the park today. [ 10 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">I hit the wall with my car, and now there is a small <u class=\"font-bold\">amount of damage</u> in it. [ 11 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">I <u class=\"font-bold\">don't believe the honesty of</u> people who always try to borrow money. [ 12 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">The conditions in some parts of Africa are very poor, and disease is <u class=\"font-bold\">very common</u>. [ 13 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">The man behaved in an <u class=\"font-bold\">untrustworthy way</u> toward his friends. [ 14 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">I'm going to <u class=\"font-bold\">go to the other side</u> of the road to meet my friend. [ 15 ]</p>",
              "options": [],
              "explanation": "sole = duy nhất",
              "correctAnswer": "sole"
            },
            {
